{"en": "Well might the sun in darkness hide, and shut his glories in,", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-alas-and-did-my-saviour-bleed", "stanza_id": "pd-alas-and-did-my-saviour-bleed-s03", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "But drops of grief can ne'er repay the debt of love I owe:", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-alas-and-did-my-saviour-bleed", "stanza_id": "pd-alas-and-did-my-saviour-bleed-s04", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "E'er since by faith I saw the stream Thy flowing wounds supply,", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-there-is-a-fountain-filled-with-blood", "stanza_id": "pd-there-is-a-fountain-filled-with-blood-s04", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "Dear Name! the rock on which I build, my shield and hiding place,", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-how-sweet-the-name-of-jesus-sounds", "stanza_id": "pd-how-sweet-the-name-of-jesus-sounds-s03", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "Jesus, my Shepherd, Husband, Friend, my Prophet, Priest, and King,", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-how-sweet-the-name-of-jesus-sounds", "stanza_id": "pd-how-sweet-the-name-of-jesus-sounds-s04", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "The Lord has promised good to me, His word my hope secures;", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-amazing-grace", "stanza_id": "pd-amazing-grace-s04", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "Ye chosen seed of Israel's race, ye ransomed from the fall,", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-all-hail-the-power-of-jesus-name", "stanza_id": "pd-all-hail-the-power-of-jesus-name-s02", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "O that with yonder sacred throng we at His feet may fall!", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-all-hail-the-power-of-jesus-name", "stanza_id": "pd-all-hail-the-power-of-jesus-name-s04", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "Holy, holy, holy! all the saints adore Thee, casting down their golden crowns around the glassy sea;", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-holy-holy-holy", "stanza_id": "pd-holy-holy-holy-s02", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "Holy, holy, holy! though the darkness hide Thee, though the eye of sinful man Thy glory may not see;", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-holy-holy-holy", "stanza_id": "pd-holy-holy-holy-s03", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "Swift to its close ebbs out life's little day; earth's joys grow dim, its glories pass away;", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-abide-with-me", "stanza_id": "pd-abide-with-me-s02", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "Hold Thou Thy cross before my closing eyes; shine through the gloom, and point me to the skies;", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-abide-with-me", "stanza_id": "pd-abide-with-me-s04", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "While I draw this fleeting breath, when my eyes shall close in death,", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-rock-of-ages", "stanza_id": "pd-rock-of-ages-s04", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "Just as I am, though tossed about with many a conflict, many a doubt,", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-just-as-i-am", "stanza_id": "pd-just-as-i-am-s03", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "Chiefest of sinners, Jesus will save; all He has promised, that He will do;", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-when-i-see-the-blood", "stanza_id": "pd-when-i-see-the-blood-s02", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "Judgment is coming, all will be there, who have rejected, who have refused;", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-when-i-see-the-blood", "stanza_id": "pd-when-i-see-the-blood-s03", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "O what a Saviour, that He died for me! From condemnation He hath made me free;", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-when-i-see-the-blood", "stanza_id": "pd-when-i-see-the-blood-s04", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "A debtor to mercy alone, of covenant mercy I sing;", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-a-debtor-to-mercy-alone", "stanza_id": "pd-a-debtor-to-mercy-alone-s01", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "The work which His goodness began, the arm of His strength will complete;", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-a-debtor-to-mercy-alone", "stanza_id": "pd-a-debtor-to-mercy-alone-s02", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "My name from the palms of His hands eternity will not erase;", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-a-debtor-to-mercy-alone", "stanza_id": "pd-a-debtor-to-mercy-alone-s03", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "A mind at perfect peace with God: O what a word is this!", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-a-mind-at-perfect-peace", "stanza_id": "pd-a-mind-at-perfect-peace-s01", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "brethren_distinctive"}
{"en": "By nature and by practice far, how very far from God!", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-a-mind-at-perfect-peace", "stanza_id": "pd-a-mind-at-perfect-peace-s02", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "brethren_distinctive"}
{"en": "So near, so very near to God, I cannot nearer be;", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-a-mind-at-perfect-peace", "stanza_id": "pd-a-mind-at-perfect-peace-s03", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "brethren_distinctive"}
{"en": "Thy body broken for my sake, my bread from heaven shall be;", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-according-to-thy-gracious-word", "stanza_id": "pd-according-to-thy-gracious-word-s02", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "Gethsemane can I forget? Or there Thy conflict see,", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-according-to-thy-gracious-word", "stanza_id": "pd-according-to-thy-gracious-word-s03", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "Upon that cross of Jesus mine eye at times can see", "es": null, "hymn_id": "bhb-classic-023", "stanza_id": "bhb-classic-023-s03", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "brethren_distinctive"}
{"en": "I take, O cross, thy shadow for my abiding place;", "es": null, "hymn_id": "bhb-classic-023", "stanza_id": "bhb-classic-023-s04", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "brethren_distinctive"}
{"en": "When through the deep waters I call thee to go, the rivers of sorrow shall not overflow;", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-how-firm-a-foundation", "stanza_id": "pd-how-firm-a-foundation-s03", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "The soul that on Jesus hath leaned for repose I will not, I will not desert to his foes;", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-how-firm-a-foundation", "stanza_id": "pd-how-firm-a-foundation-s04", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "Under the shadow of Thy throne Thy saints have dwelt secure;", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-o-god-our-help-in-ages-past", "stanza_id": "pd-o-god-our-help-in-ages-past-s02", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "A thousand ages in Thy sight are like an evening gone;", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-o-god-our-help-in-ages-past", "stanza_id": "pd-o-god-our-help-in-ages-past-s04", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "When I tread the verge of Jordan, bid my anxious fears subside;", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-guide-me-o-thou-great-jehovah", "stanza_id": "pd-guide-me-o-thou-great-jehovah-s03", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "Lifted up was He to die, It is finished was His cry;", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-man-of-sorrows", "stanza_id": "pd-man-of-sorrows-s04", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "Though Satan should buffet, though trials should come, let this blest assurance control,", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-it-is-well", "stanza_id": "pd-it-is-well-s02", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "And Lord, haste the day when the faith shall be sight, the clouds be rolled back as a scroll,", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-it-is-well", "stanza_id": "pd-it-is-well-s04", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "I heard the voice of Jesus say, Behold, I freely give", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-i-heard-the-voice", "stanza_id": "pd-i-heard-the-voice-s02", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "brethren_distinctive"}
{"en": "I stand amazed in the presence of Jesus the Nazarene,", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-i-stand-amazed-in-the-presence", "stanza_id": "pd-i-stand-amazed-in-the-presence-s01", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "srgh_called"}
{"en": "For me it was in the garden He prayed, Not My will, but Thine;", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-i-stand-amazed-in-the-presence", "stanza_id": "pd-i-stand-amazed-in-the-presence-s02", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "srgh_called"}
{"en": "He took my sins and my sorrows, He made them His very own;", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-i-stand-amazed-in-the-presence", "stanza_id": "pd-i-stand-amazed-in-the-presence-s03", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "srgh_called"}
{"en": "Yet there is room! The Lamb's bright hall of song, with its fair glory, beckons thee along;", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-yet-there-is-room", "stanza_id": "pd-yet-there-is-room-s01", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "srgh_called"}
{"en": "Day is declining, and the Saviour cries: Room for the weary, room for thee;", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-yet-there-is-room", "stanza_id": "pd-yet-there-is-room-s02", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "srgh_called"}
{"en": "Room, room, still room! O enter, enter now; room, room, still room!", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-yet-there-is-room", "stanza_id": "pd-yet-there-is-room-s03", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "srgh_called"}
{"en": "We've a story to tell to the nations that shall turn their hearts to the right,", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-weve-a-story-to-tell", "stanza_id": "pd-weve-a-story-to-tell-s01", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "srgh_called"}
{"en": "We've a song to be sung to the nations that shall lift their hearts to the Lord,", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-weve-a-story-to-tell", "stanza_id": "pd-weve-a-story-to-tell-s02", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "srgh_called"}
{"en": "We've a message to give to the nations, that the Lord who reigneth above", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-weve-a-story-to-tell", "stanza_id": "pd-weve-a-story-to-tell-s03", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "srgh_called"}
{"en": "Enough for me that Jesus saves, this ends my fear and doubt;", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-my-faith-has-found-a-resting-place", "stanza_id": "pd-my-faith-has-found-a-resting-place-s02", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "srgh_called"}
{"en": "My heart is leaning on the Word, the written Word of God,", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-my-faith-has-found-a-resting-place", "stanza_id": "pd-my-faith-has-found-a-resting-place-s03", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "srgh_called"}
{"en": "One there is above all others, well deserves the name of Friend;", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-one-there-is-above-all-others", "stanza_id": "pd-one-there-is-above-all-others-s01", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "srgh_called"}
{"en": "Which of all our friends, to save us, could or would have shed his blood?", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-one-there-is-above-all-others", "stanza_id": "pd-one-there-is-above-all-others-s02", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "srgh_called"}
{"en": "When He lived on earth abased, Friend of sinners was His name;", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-one-there-is-above-all-others", "stanza_id": "pd-one-there-is-above-all-others-s03", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "srgh_called"}
{"en": "Thou, O Christ, art all I want; more than all in Thee I find;", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-jesus-lover-of-my-soul", "stanza_id": "pd-jesus-lover-of-my-soul-s03", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "Perfect submission, perfect delight, visions of rapture now burst on my sight;", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-blessed-assurance", "stanza_id": "pd-blessed-assurance-s02", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "Perfect submission, all is at rest, I in my Saviour am happy and blest;", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-blessed-assurance", "stanza_id": "pd-blessed-assurance-s03", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "Though like the wanderer, the sun gone down, darkness be over me, my rest a stone,", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-nearer-my-god-to-thee", "stanza_id": "pd-nearer-my-god-to-thee-s02", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "There let the way appear steps unto heaven; all that Thou sendest me in mercy given;", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-nearer-my-god-to-thee", "stanza_id": "pd-nearer-my-god-to-thee-s03", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "Crown Him the Lord of love; behold His hands and side,", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-crown-him-with-many-crowns", "stanza_id": "pd-crown-him-with-many-crowns-s02", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "Crown Him the Lord of life, who triumphed o'er the grave,", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-crown-him-with-many-crowns", "stanza_id": "pd-crown-him-with-many-crowns-s03", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "Here I raise my Ebenezer; hither by Thy help I'm come;", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-come-thou-fount", "stanza_id": "pd-come-thou-fount-s02", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "My soul He doth restore again, and me to walk doth make", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-the-lords-my-shepherd", "stanza_id": "pd-the-lords-my-shepherd-s02", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "Yea, though I walk in death's dark vale, yet will I fear none ill;", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-the-lords-my-shepherd", "stanza_id": "pd-the-lords-my-shepherd-s03", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "Be Thou my Vision, O Lord of my heart; naught be all else to me, save that Thou art;", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-be-thou-my-vision", "stanza_id": "pd-be-thou-my-vision-s01", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "Be Thou my Wisdom, and Thou my true Word; I ever with Thee and Thou with me, Lord;", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-be-thou-my-vision", "stanza_id": "pd-be-thou-my-vision-s02", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "Riches I heed not, nor man's empty praise; Thou mine inheritance, now and always;", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-be-thou-my-vision", "stanza_id": "pd-be-thou-my-vision-s03", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "Fair are the meadows, fairer still the woodlands, robed in the blooming garb of spring;", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-fairest-lord-jesus", "stanza_id": "pd-fairest-lord-jesus-s02", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "Fair is the sunshine, fairer still the moonlight, and all the twinkling starry host;", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-fairest-lord-jesus", "stanza_id": "pd-fairest-lord-jesus-s03", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "To Him shall endless prayer be made, and praises throng to crown His head;", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-jesus-shall-reign", "stanza_id": "pd-jesus-shall-reign-s02", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "People and realms of every tongue dwell on His love with sweetest song;", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-jesus-shall-reign", "stanza_id": "pd-jesus-shall-reign-s03", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "generic_pd"}
{"en": "Around Thy table, holy Lord, in sweet communion draw near,", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-when-i-survey-brethren-table", "stanza_id": "pd-when-i-survey-brethren-table-s01", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "brethren_distinctive"}
{"en": "Here every one that loves Thy name our willing thanks may bring;", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-when-i-survey-brethren-table", "stanza_id": "pd-when-i-survey-brethren-table-s02", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "brethren_distinctive"}
{"en": "O Lord, what love is this of Thine, that draws us to Thy feet!", "es": null, "hymn_id": "pd-when-i-survey-brethren-table", "stanza_id": "pd-when-i-survey-brethren-table-s03", "en_source": "pd", "es_source": null, "needs_synthetic": true, "license": "public_domain", "priority": "brethren_distinctive"}
